Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Directors: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Episode 4{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.48,0:01:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Mr. Oh, have you left? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.90,0:01:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What? Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.53,0:01:20.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It was in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.62,0:01:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.50,0:01:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Hae-in, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:32.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.13,0:01:33.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.63,0:01:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.85,0:01:45.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.35,0:01:48.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.02,0:01:50.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What am I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.40,0:01:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,doing right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.98,0:01:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.15,0:02:00.36,Default,,0,0,0,,you found your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.41,0:02:04.69,Default,,0,0,0,,It could've been a hassle to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why wasn't I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.80,0:02:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,confident?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.93,0:02:21.75,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.60,0:02:24.59,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.10,0:02:29.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.77,0:02:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to start...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.07,0:02:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,trying new things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.31,0:04:34.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.19,0:04:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.61,0:04:47.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.42,0:05:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.22,0:05:06.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.61,0:05:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll recharge in no time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.28,0:05:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.15,0:05:28.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He could've just said...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.20,0:05:29.98,Default,,0,0,0,,he wanted to come in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.39,0:06:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in's birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.35,0:06:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,The day the department store went public.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.64,0:06:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My birthday?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:44.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be our wedding anniversary.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.65,0:06:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,One Billion Club?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.90,0:06:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Try again in 30 seconds{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.94,0:06:48.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.98,0:07:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.40,0:07:30.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's 1031?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.82,0:07:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}9 Unread Messages{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Delete{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.44,0:07:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}8 Unread Messages{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.46,0:07:43.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, done.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.21,0:07:44.91,Default,,0,0,0,,My gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.13,0:07:48.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You startled me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.38,0:07:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.81,0:07:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.22,0:08:01.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.56,0:08:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't sleep, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.36,0:08:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so you came to my room?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.08,0:08:27.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.79,0:08:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.92,0:08:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't sleep because of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.89,0:08:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.23,0:08:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not like that at all. I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.94,0:08:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I just couldn't sleep,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.77,0:08:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,for no particular reason,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.07,0:08:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so I came to see if you were feeling the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.45,0:08:59.72,Default,,0,0,0,,and...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.74,0:09:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,if you wanted to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.62,0:09:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,But you're too tired, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.54,0:09:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bit tired,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.00,0:09:12.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but let's do it. Let's talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.84,0:09:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,So where?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.80,0:09:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we sit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.93,0:09:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.76,0:09:21.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.47,0:09:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,only of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.18,0:09:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You had a few drinks, and it's pretty late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.02,0:09:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.27,0:09:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.31,0:09:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, I think I've sobered\Nup a little. Let's sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.86,0:09:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Don't sit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.78,0:09:39.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I was being thoughtless.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.41,0:09:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.20,0:09:45.95,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a lot to do tomorrow. You should rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.21,0:09:49.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good night's sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.29,0:09:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Lie down.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.34,0:10:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,He cares...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.27,0:10:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,so much for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.82,0:10:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That was so close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.01,0:10:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}No way...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.22,0:10:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It's 1031?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.77,0:10:54.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Congratulations. You're four weeks pregnant.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.99,0:10:59.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Well...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Four weeks...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.70,0:11:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Then when will the baby be born?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.58,0:11:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It's due on October 31.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.87,0:11:12.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I see. October 31.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.92,0:11:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}That's a good date.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.63,0:11:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}October 31.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.90,0:11:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Please use top-quality eco-\Nfriendly interior materials.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Right. I hear that thing is\Na must for a baby's room.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I ought to...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.82,0:12:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,How could you go there?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.95,0:12:26.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we've never met her\Nproperly since they got married,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.95,0:12:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- but they suddenly mentioned divorce, so...\N- Mom, I tried to stop her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.29,0:12:32.99,Default,,0,0,0,,And you went with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.17,0:12:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, what did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.62,0:12:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.88,0:12:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yeah.\N- Only Hyun-woo was thinking of divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.53,0:12:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.55,0:12:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,And she said she'd come visit us soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.59,0:12:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,- And Dad.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.85,0:12:51.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally added her on my messenger app!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.93,0:12:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But what about Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.02,0:12:57.25,Default,,0,0,0,,He says he won't divorce her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.27,0:12:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're doing well. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.81,0:13:01.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's a relief.\N- No they aren't!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.07,0:13:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He was considering divorce\Nwhile his wife had no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You think they're doing well?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.86,0:13:09.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of them know how the other feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.79,0:13:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Invite me in the chat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.37,0:13:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't say much or send photos.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.14,0:13:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}We'll now take a photo of the\Nfamily members and relatives.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.48,0:13:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Ms. Kim.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yes?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.41,0:13:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I know...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.95,0:13:54.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}you don't like Hyun-woo as your son-in-law.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.58,0:13:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm not sure if I should say this,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.12,0:14:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}but when Hyun-woo told us he was seeing someone,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.75,0:14:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}he said the girl might get fired\Nand become unemployed soon,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.38,0:14:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}so he'd have to provide\Nfor her if he married her.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.72,0:14:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Then our family said\Nhe could find a better girl,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.10,0:14:14.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}and that she was too poor.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.64,0:14:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Even a family like us was being so calculating.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.39,0:14:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I can't imagine how you felt.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.35,0:14:25.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}There's a great difference. I'm sure\Nyou were upset and disappointed.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:28.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}We're all human, after all,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.24,0:14:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}so...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.57,0:14:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I understand.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.62,0:14:35.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Right. I'm glad you understand.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:37.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I know...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.20,0:14:38.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}my son lacks a lot,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.83,0:14:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}but I hope you take good care of him.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.25,0:14:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}He lacks a lot? You clearly don't know your son.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.92,0:14:47.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}He managed to marry my daughter.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.17,0:14:49.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}He's really something.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.30,0:14:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pardon?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.76,0:14:53.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It's a compliment. As a lawyer, he should be...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}good at calculating, being practical,\Nand taking what he wants.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:15:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- What do you...?\N- I'm saying he's smart...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.31,0:15:02.43,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}that he didn't miss this opportunity.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What do you mean, "this opportunity"?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.36,0:15:08.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm sure you know.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.49,0:15:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Right.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:12.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Whatever you mean by it,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.16,0:15:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}it's a marriage between our kids.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.24,0:15:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I know that.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.49,0:15:20.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Exactly. I just wanted to say it'd be nice,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.25,0:15:23.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}as their parents, if we could help them...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.75,0:15:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}lead a happy marriage. That's all.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:28.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}If it's their marriage,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.59,0:15:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}it's their business to lead a happy life.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.55,0:15:34.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Why should we help?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.64,0:15:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Who is she to tell me what to do?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.36,0:15:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Divorce or not,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.44,0:15:49.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.32,0:15:54.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Please live a good life, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.87,0:15:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Shoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Don't forget to drink\Norange juice in the morning.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.43,0:16:16.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}That's your hangover cure.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.43,0:16:21.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that too cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.18,0:16:23.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to make you some tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.85,0:16:25.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Something warm would be better.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.69,0:16:27.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.65,0:16:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.42,0:16:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep yourself presentable. You're not a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.15,0:17:12.52,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.28,0:17:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wondered why my heart was pounding.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.99,0:17:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It was because I was scared. That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.45,0:17:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why my heart was racing so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.14,0:17:50.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think? I'm wearing\Nthis to the meeting tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:17:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.32,0:18:03.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a Hercyna vintage jacket from 1982.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is that true?\N- There are only two pieces in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.79,0:18:08.60,Default,,0,0,0,,CEO Hermann's wife has one,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.62,0:18:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and the other is this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.30,0:18:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.59,0:18:20.29,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.47,0:18:22.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:29.39,Default,,0,0,0,,It looks fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.91,0:18:43.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does she look pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:46.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.46,0:18:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why on earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.33,0:18:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.47,0:19:06.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.98,0:19:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I like your suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.52,0:19:14.58,Default,,0,0,0,,My suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.61,0:19:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. You look good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.63,0:19:37.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be in a good mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.59,0:19:39.69,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.72,0:19:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But you were humming.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.43,0:19:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,- Me?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.43,0:19:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- When?\N- Just now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.61,0:19:58.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you excited?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.82,0:20:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she complimented you?\NIs that why you were humming?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.57,0:20:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, have I gone crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.28,0:20:09.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I have, since she hasn't\Ncomplimented me in so long, or...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.71,0:20:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at her frown. She's unhappy with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll throw a fit soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.09,0:20:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Five, four, three, two, one.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.35,0:20:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to decorating the\Npersonal-shopper room like a gallery?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.39,0:20:33.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- Oh, no.\N- The artist's reputation and colors...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.89,0:20:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,don't suit the interior design!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.15,0:20:40.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yelling and glaring like\Nthat, she looks so mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.73,0:20:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why I get scared and my heart races.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.28,0:20:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is what I was talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.45,0:20:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened? She's excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.00,0:20:55.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.39,0:21:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What the...? What's wrong with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.14,0:21:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I smile?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:14.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Get a grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.94,0:21:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Hey, that's dangerous.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.44,0:21:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You know how actors fall in love for\Nreal while filming romantic scenes together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:22.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Like Hyun Bin and Son Ye-jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.28,0:21:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.78,0:21:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,And yet you bought her shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.08,0:21:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Goodness.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.54,0:21:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}The whole point of an escalator\Nis to avoid having to walk up.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.16,0:21:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}She's so impatient.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.25,0:21:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I can't believe her.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:43.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Watch out!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.60,0:21:53.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Did someone just yell?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.77,0:21:54.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I heard it too.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.89,0:21:57.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What kind of lunatic yells like that here?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.57,0:22:08.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sir?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.16,0:22:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}May I help you?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.78,0:22:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Well...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.74,0:22:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Do you have a pair of these in size 6?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.58,0:22:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why you bought the shoes for her?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.54,0:22:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She hasn't changed her will. I can't let her...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.84,0:22:25.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- fall and die.\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.09,0:22:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- So that's why?\N- Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.59,0:22:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Even I was surprised...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.84,0:22:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,that I was so calculating and cold-hearted.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.55,0:22:32.88,Default,,0,0,0,,So what did she say?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.94,0:22:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}So you bought them because they were 50% off?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:50.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}And today is the last day.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.78,0:22:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Plus, 6 is a popular size,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.28,0:22:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}and the white ones are\Nsold out all over the country.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.79,0:22:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Except for this pair.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.71,0:23:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I had to buy them.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.67,0:23:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm sure you did,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.75,0:23:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}but my shoe closet...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:08.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}is full of expensive shoes\NI had to pay extra to buy.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.72,0:23:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Would I ever wear ones bought at half price?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.59,0:23:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Of course I know you have a lot\Nof expensive, luxurious shoes,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.40,0:23:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}but none of them are comfy.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.77,0:23:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- They're pretty.\N- You're pretty even without them.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.27,0:23:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Besides, the heels are so thin and high.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.91,0:23:34.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm worried you might fall,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.45,0:23:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}so why don't you...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.29,0:23:39.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}wear comfy shoes once in a while?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.54,0:23:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Leave them here, then.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.84,0:23:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She didn't like them then.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.59,0:23:49.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't believe her reaction.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.88,0:23:51.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But even more unbelievable?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.26,0:23:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.01,0:23:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She wore them.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.23,0:24:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Wow, Ms. Hong looks so...\N- Right?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.36,0:24:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Pretty, right?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.40,0:24:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}No, she looks so feisty today.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.28,0:24:17.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Like she's ready to crush anyone.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.00,0:24:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Exactly.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.50,0:24:26.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Anyway, those two meet so often these days.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.33,0:24:28.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- This is Secretary Na.\N- Hi.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.92,0:24:30.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Right.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.92,0:24:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It's because of the Hercyna store.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.97,0:24:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Recently Mr. Yoon has been visiting every day,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.05,0:24:39.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}having meals and coffee,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.56,0:24:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}and even taking walks with her.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.81,0:24:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It seems you don't know this,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.35,0:24:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}but workaholics even use...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.36,0:24:52.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}mealtimes and coffee breaks to talk about work.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.28,0:24:53.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}That's why.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.25,0:25:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Mr. Yoon may be her friend,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.04,0:25:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}but he clearly doesn't know Hae-in well.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.67,0:25:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hae-in hates it...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.84,0:25:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}when someone touches her hair like that.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.63,0:25:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}She's smiling.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.30,0:25:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}It seems she doesn't really hate it.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.39,0:25:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So is it bothering you?\NDoes it make you jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.39,0:25:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you even listening? Don't you get my point?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.48,0:25:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your point. You're jealous.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.82,0:25:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you know what "jealousy" means?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.15,0:25:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you feel when you like someone,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.86,0:25:39.63,Default,,0,0,0,,and a rival happens to show up.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.66,0:25:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the wrong premise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.03,0:25:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't even like Hae-in.\NWhy would I be jealous?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.54,0:25:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- So it doesn't bother you?\N- No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.33,0:25:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care if they're close,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.71,0:25:50.81,Default,,0,0,0,,or if they go anywhere together.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.84,0:25:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it, but what are you\Ngrilling instead of meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.10,0:26:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you wearing those?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.48,0:26:14.77,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband bought them for me, and\Nasked that I wear them. What can I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.36,0:26:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, we're meeting the CEO of Hercyna.\NWouldn't it be better to wear their shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.95,0:26:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to find you some?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.28,0:26:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm wearing their clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.08,0:26:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Their shoes are uncomfortable,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.87,0:26:29.02,Default,,0,0,0,,and he's worried that I might fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.04,0:26:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.00,0:26:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo is.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.30,0:26:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What a worrywart.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.27,0:26:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.19,0:26:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.91,0:27:03.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever Hermann says, just listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.87,0:27:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,When he's done,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.66,0:27:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,just say one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.85,0:27:33.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Sara Lopez?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.73,0:27:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}She's a popular designer in Europe.\NWe're planning to open up a store.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.62,0:27:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What about her?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.65,0:27:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}She's Hermann's new mistress.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.74,0:27:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}His wife doesn't know?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.79,0:27:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}She's a hot-tempered, competent lawyer.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.29,0:27:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}If she finds out,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.87,0:27:56.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}he'll never see his baby girl.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.09,0:28:41.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Hermann was glaring at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.09,0:28:46.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Because besides the two,\NI was the only one who knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.22,0:28:49.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't you in a fix, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.06,0:28:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.27,0:28:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a few more cards to play against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.44,0:28:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Ye-na was right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.15,0:29:01.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not the Eun-sung I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.82,0:29:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.53,0:29:07.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I've worked very hard...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.87,0:29:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,to hear this from you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.08,0:29:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,A debt or kindness, I always\Nrepay it. I owe you one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.33,0:29:19.74,Default,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll hold you to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.63,0:29:28.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Walnut and Peanut Snacks{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.43,0:29:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,One bag of peanut cakes, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.06,0:29:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.19,0:29:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Please pack it in two layers.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.27,0:29:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.81,0:29:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- You're bringing it home?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.82,0:29:48.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is why I'm suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.70,0:29:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,In my eyes, if you think of\Nher when you see these snacks...
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.79,0:29:54.99,Default,,0,0,0,,when you're drunk,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.71,0:29:57.89,Default,,0,0,0,,it means you love her!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.92,0:29:58.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Love, my foot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.00,0:30:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- They're just peanut cakes.\N- Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.42,0:30:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You want one too?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.42,0:30:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- Thanks.\N- Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.55,0:30:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.01,0:30:10.71,Default,,0,0,0,,peanut cakes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.06,0:30:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Where are you? Hurry home.\NI have something to tell you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.39,0:30:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Don't worry. It's good news you'll love.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.11,0:30:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Something to tell me?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.36,0:30:25.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Good news you'll love?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.90,0:30:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.61,0:30:30.97,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- "I leave all my assets..."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.99,0:30:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,"to Baek Hyun-woo."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.87,0:30:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Changing her will.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.16,0:30:40.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Come on. No way.\N- Yes way!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.50,0:30:42.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It must be it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.75,0:30:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Congrats, you punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.30,0:30:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,- Don't forget about me.\N- It can't be that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.51,0:30:48.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.68,0:30:50.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.47,0:30:54.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.22,0:30:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.60,0:31:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,These are peanut cakes. Want some?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.24,0:31:14.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I wanted to give you this before it got cold,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.99,0:31:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,so I rushed home.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.04,0:31:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,How is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.88,0:31:23.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.00,0:31:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's still warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.13,0:31:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.59,0:31:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.51,0:31:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,what's this good news I'll love?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.18,0:31:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.64,0:31:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.02,0:31:44.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.61,0:31:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.03,0:31:56.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.54,0:32:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.29,0:32:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.63,0:32:06.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it just earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.13,0:32:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's from one of the best\Ncancer centers in Europe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.05,0:32:13.13,Default,,0,0,0,,On the next pages are their research papers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.14,0:32:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.27,0:32:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.39,0:32:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,They think they can cure me,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.61,0:32:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- ...and the chance...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.82,0:32:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,is over 50%.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.86,0:32:35.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Over?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.62,0:32:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you'd be so happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.12,0:32:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.44,0:32:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,The chance is about 51%,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.34,0:32:49.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and they'd like to do clinical treatments on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.00,0:32:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's true.\N- What did I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.26,0:32:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I said I'd never lose to that illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.93,0:32:56.88,Default,,0,0,0,,That God's on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.93,0:32:59.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on my side,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.64,0:33:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,and so is God.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.93,0:33:04.51,Default,,0,0,0,,My goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.06,0:33:07.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel so reassured.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.72,0:33:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,If...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.52,0:33:46.55,Default,,0,0,0,,she's cured,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.23,0:33:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,then...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.90,0:33:50.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}The team dinner finished...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.23,0:33:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- at 9:30 last night, so why...?\N- Why did you have to bring it up at...?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.07,0:33:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Didn't I tell you?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.15,0:33:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm just worried.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.66,0:34:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Say something!\N- It's not Hyun-woo.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.32,0:34:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- You're a part of our Hong family!\N- Hyun-woo!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.08,0:34:10.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hurry up. We're going to be late.\NThis is why you're always late.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.50,0:34:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- I'm sorry.\N- You're so frustrating.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.17,0:34:58.96,Default,,0,0,0,,A life like that...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.47,0:35:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,for 50 more years?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.51,0:35:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.47,0:35:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I should get a divorce...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.43,0:35:10.89,Default,,0,0,0,,as I originally planned.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.40,0:35:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.23,0:35:17.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.11,0:35:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now that I've been cured,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.53,0:35:22.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}you're going to betray me?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.62,0:35:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You got your life back,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.20,0:35:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so I want mine back too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.08,0:35:33.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Right.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.13,0:35:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}People can feel that way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.09,0:35:38.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's understandable.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.51,0:35:43.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}However...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.31,0:35:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Not my people.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.41,0:36:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be worse than my imagination.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.59,0:36:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I'm exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.04,0:36:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Goodness.\N- Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.21,0:36:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.55,0:36:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, it's exhausting.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.26,0:36:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.01,0:36:28.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gotten a lot better.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.89,0:36:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, aren't you thirsty? Have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.27,0:36:35.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.56,0:36:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I really drink this?\NYou didn't poison it, did you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.48,0:36:42.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Dad. Just drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.61,0:36:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.49,0:36:46.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I was always like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.62,0:36:49.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.37,0:36:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We used to be so happy together.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.12,0:36:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, we used to be, before\Nsome wench entered the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.04,0:36:56.94,Default,,0,0,0,,We weren't this messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.96,0:36:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hong, I'll go inside first.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.14,0:37:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, do you remember...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.10,0:37:16.58,Default,,0,0,0,,how much you adored me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:16.60,0:37:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You doted on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.69,0:37:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,You always bought a gift for me on\Nyour way back from your business trips.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.65,0:37:23.59,Default,,0,0,0,,That was ages ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.61,0:37:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You always told me to live with\Nyou forever without getting married,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.95,0:37:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and see? I'm still with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:30.41,0:37:33.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell you to get married and come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.69,0:37:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.75,0:37:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Love is about coming back, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.00,0:37:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did I come back within\Nthree years whenever I got married?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.17,0:37:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.05,0:37:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,your lovely daughter loves you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.72,0:37:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop. I'm eating soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.97,0:37:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll lose my appetite.\N- Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.85,0:37:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't lose your appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.10,0:37:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,At your age, it's more dangerous\Nthan running out of money.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.35,0:37:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it? Just say it.\NWhy are you being like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.11,0:38:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's my birthday\Nthe day after tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.94,0:38:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.57,0:38:09.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I just want to go on a date with\Nmy beloved dad, just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.57,0:38:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please?\N- My gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.91,0:38:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.62,0:38:17.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to have something delicious with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.04,0:38:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,- Stop it.\N- Will you treat me to something nice?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.67,0:38:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, stop. That's gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.21,0:38:24.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop! Go away!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.20,0:38:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.74,0:38:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hello.\N- Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.41,0:38:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here in\Nthe morning on a weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.41,0:38:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,For the negotiation with Hercyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.10,0:39:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I should join you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.63,0:39:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The legal team should be in\Nthe loop to work on the details.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.63,0:39:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That'll come later.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.67,0:39:10.15,Default,,0,0,0,,We're discussing the\Nnegotiation between the CEOs,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.18,0:39:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,to get rid of any deal-breaking factors.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.68,0:39:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Are we bothering you? We can go somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.27,0:39:19.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What about my hotel?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.48,0:39:21.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You can just do it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.15,0:39:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Here, comfortably.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.77,0:39:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.40,0:39:27.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I should thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.90,0:39:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,You're helping my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.15,0:39:31.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Want some coffee?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.16,0:39:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, thanks.\N- Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.78,0:39:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You too? You don't drink\Ncoffee on an empty stomach.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.75,0:39:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.42,0:39:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- An espresso for you, right?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.14,0:40:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,She cares for me so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.98,0:40:06.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.40,0:40:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,She says coffee's like poison on\Nan empty stomach and it's unhealthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.86,0:40:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,She doesn't let me drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.07,0:40:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I'm not her kid, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.87,0:40:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess she can't stop...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.16,0:40:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,worrying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.25,0:40:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in must care so much for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.71,0:40:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I envy you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.75,0:40:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yes. I think so too.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.88,0:40:32.86,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not like that to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.88,0:40:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,She always asks me for help, saying\NI'm the only one who can help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.56,0:40:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,She was always like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.64,0:40:44.33,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd call me anytime asking for help,\Nsaying I was the only one she had.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.35,0:40:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How couldn't I help, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.02,0:40:50.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Even this time around. This kind of\Nnegotiation could even take a year,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.15,0:40:53.19,Default,,0,0,0,,but she asked me to finish it in two weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.90,0:40:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't have time to do\Nanything else while I'm in Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.62,0:40:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.74,0:41:01.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I have to be stuck with her all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.87,0:41:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.46,0:41:09.41,Default,,0,0,0,,reassuring.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.76,0:41:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you bringing this to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.90,0:41:28.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm suddenly curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.94,0:41:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.02,0:41:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you hate it when\Nsomeone touches your hair?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.82,0:41:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- I mean,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:35.07,0:41:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,when I touched it last time,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.66,0:41:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,you yelled at me, saying\NI was ruining your hairstyle.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.53,0:41:42.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.62,0:41:44.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Put it simply.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.37,0:41:47.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You got angry when I did it,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.13,0:41:50.83,Default,,0,0,0,,so why didn't you when Mr. Yoon did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.25,0:41:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.43,0:41:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That's because...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.43,0:41:59.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to be fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.68,0:42:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Not just Mr. Yoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.39,0:42:04.22,Default,,0,0,0,,If any guy touches your hair,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.43,0:42:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,you should get angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:07.94,0:42:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Except for your hairdresser.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.66,0:42:27.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She just left...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.04,0:42:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,without saying anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.72,0:42:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How could she do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.35,0:42:46.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.85,0:42:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.32,0:42:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.03,0:43:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.28,0:43:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been this\Nannoyed with someone's smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.74,0:43:07.99,Default,,0,0,0,,He really is something.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.09,0:43:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's still smiling. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.68,0:43:25.42,Default,,0,0,0,,That jerk. Why is he pulling\Nit down? Hey, you jerk. Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.60,0:43:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.48,0:43:31.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.65,0:43:34.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You think I can't watch you if you do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.15,0:43:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find a way, no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:55.42,0:43:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.42,0:43:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,just walking by.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.59,0:44:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Walking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:03.68,0:44:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not because I'm curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.19,0:44:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.69,0:44:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.98,0:44:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.03,0:44:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't you say "Honey"?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:22.49,0:44:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.37,0:44:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.37,0:44:27.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I must've heard wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.62,0:44:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.29,0:44:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, carry on.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.83,0:44:34.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Call me if you need me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.58,0:44:36.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I won't need you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.54,0:44:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.17,0:44:40.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm resting.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.97,0:44:43.78,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey.\N- Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.80,0:44:44.94,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.97,0:44:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Eun-sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.18,0:44:49.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard my sister was bothering\Nyou on Sunday, so I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:49.60,0:44:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, get lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.48,0:44:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,We're working.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.81,0:44:55.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, I tried to contact you many times,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.77,0:44:57.00,Default,,0,0,0,,but your secretary...
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.02,0:44:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't suit your international,\Nclean-cut image.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:59.86,0:45:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,She hung up on me without knowing\Nhow close we are. I was so hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.78,0:45:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Really? I'll talk to them, Mr. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.62,0:45:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be so formal with me. Just\Ntreat me like your little brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.25,0:45:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously, I feel closer to you than Hyun-woo,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.62,0:45:17.78,Default,,0,0,0,,who's been my brother-in-law for three years.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.21,0:45:20.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're still here?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.46,0:45:23.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.13,0:45:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, don't come out.\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.09,0:45:26.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.01,0:45:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you eaten yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.85,0:45:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so down?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.02,0:45:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The way I see it, Eun-sung's like your new hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.98,0:45:38.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.40,0:45:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in has a 51% chance of living now.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:41.65,0:45:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course you should be happy for her,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.15,0:45:46.71,Default,,0,0,0,,but your hope is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.74,0:45:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hope for a rich and safe parting.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.41,0:45:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.49,0:45:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Eun-sung and Hae-in fall in love?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.00,0:45:58.06,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll get alimony.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.08,0:45:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,No, not Yoon Eun-sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.42,0:46:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.71,0:46:04.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy's creepy.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.63,0:46:09.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.30,0:46:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I think he's your savior.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.10,0:46:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be grateful\Nthat he's come to save you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:15.39,0:46:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something off with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.69,0:46:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- I can feel it.\N- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.19,0:46:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Who cares what your savior is like?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.95,0:46:30.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're drowning, and you don't\Nlike the rescuer, will you not...
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.03,0:46:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,grab the rope?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.46,0:46:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case, I can't let it be that jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.75,0:46:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.21,0:46:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.26,0:46:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Eun-sung.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.34,0:46:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,See this land? It's a 825 acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.68,0:46:53.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Neverland is 355 acres and Souland is 230 acres.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.81,0:46:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,It's bigger than the two combined.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.60,0:46:57.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:58.06,0:47:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You know the two most important\Nthings in the resort business,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.02,0:47:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,securing the land and licensing.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.94,0:47:07.02,Default,,0,0,0,,As you can see, we have the\Nland, and as for licensing...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.95,0:47:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,We have our person in the Ministry of Land.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.57,0:47:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.28,0:47:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He studied with Queens scholarships,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.50,0:47:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,and he was my tutor.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.37,0:47:20.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- I see.\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.42,0:47:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,K-pop, K-drama. Korean content\Nis so popular these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.96,0:47:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's outdo Disney together, Eun-sung!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.68,0:47:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.79,0:47:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.79,0:47:59.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He meets all these people?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.71,0:48:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know Robert Bailey,\Nthe legendary hedge fund manager?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.08,0:48:06.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Among his 12 apprentices,\Nthis guy's the best one.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.25,0:48:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Robert even entrusted his asset management\Nwith him. What more is there to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.97,0:48:13.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.09,0:48:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's perfect as Mr. Hong Soo-cheol's partner,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.39,0:48:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's quite picky, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.27,0:48:24.21,Default,,0,0,0,,But he's willingly helping\NHae-in regarding Hercyna.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.23,0:48:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, since the two are so close,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.90,0:48:33.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and that might be why Mr. Yoon\Nisn't getting close to Mr. Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.99,0:48:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.32,0:48:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.37,0:48:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,For Ms. Hong,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.62,0:48:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,if Hercyna opens in her mall, she'll\Nreach $1 billion in sales for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:41.79,0:48:46.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Then the chairman will lean towards\Ngiving the group to her, as he promised.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.75,0:48:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying...
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.05,0:48:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in doesn't want Soo-cheol to succeed\Nin attracting investment for the resort?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.30,0:48:57.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! Soo-cheol could turn the tables.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:58.22,0:49:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, I don't know what\NMs. Hong told Mr. Yoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.73,0:49:06.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but it seems he doesn't consider\NMr. Hong as a potential partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.02,0:49:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's having dinner with Chairman\NYeom's grandchild tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.78,0:49:15.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortune-telling doesn't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.70,0:49:17.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.03,0:49:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Hong's fated to prey\Non her siblings all her life.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.66,0:49:27.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, you don't need\Nanything else to deal with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.75,0:49:30.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Fortune-telling is like the Bible to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:30.25,0:49:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,If you look up anything online and tell her,
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.26,0:49:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,she just believes it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.68,0:49:37.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But that worked to your advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.26,0:49:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true. I've benefited a\Nlot from it for about 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.80,0:50:22.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What brings you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.48,0:50:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.35,0:50:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't withdrawn the suit, your mall\Nin Gwanggyo wouldn't even be happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.15,0:50:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want that?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.74,0:50:39.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop beating around the bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.87,0:50:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Just tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:42.95,0:50:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you tell Eun-sung about Soo-cheol?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.70,0:50:49.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you say that made him\Nnot consider investing in Soo-cheol?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:49.83,0:50:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.04,0:50:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,It's obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.46,0:50:57.40,Default,,0,0,0,,"If Soo-cheol gets investment, it's bad\Nfor me, so invest in Sang-jin instead."
Dialogue: 0,0:50:57.42,0:50:59.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Because that'd make the chairman furious.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.89,0:51:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think that even makes sense?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:03.68,0:51:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes! I think you're more\Nthan capable of doing that,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.43,0:51:09.97,Default,,0,0,0,,because you're a wench\Nwho's selfish to the bone.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.02,0:51:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't care if anyone around you dies.\NYou just find a way to save yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:14.15,0:51:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's why your older brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.83,0:51:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She's been feeling unwell since this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.66,0:51:30.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I think she needs to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.17,0:51:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:32.79,0:51:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,So are you telling me to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.92,0:51:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,When I'm still talking to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.63,0:51:42.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.30,0:52:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's tell your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.34,0:52:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I said no.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.34,0:52:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Situations like earlier can happen anytime.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.26,0:52:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,They might find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.22,0:52:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get treated.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.39,0:52:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting like I'll drop dead tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.77,0:52:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You're being...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.73,0:52:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,selfish and irresponsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.32,0:52:39.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.82,0:52:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,You're thinking about your money,\Nstocks, and the One Billion Club. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.57,0:52:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that you're worried your family\Ncould take what's yours if they find out,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.83,0:52:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.37,0:52:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,keeping this important matter from them...
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.13,0:52:58.08,Default,,0,0,0,,because you don't want anything to be taken.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.63,0:53:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.22,0:53:05.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to shock them.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.89,0:53:09.76,Default,,0,0,0,,My parents...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.77,0:53:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,They already lost a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.95,0:53:27.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So why scare them?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.33,0:53:33.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I can never be a good daughter, anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.33,0:53:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.50,0:53:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,don't want to be a more\Nterrible existence to my family,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.50,0:53:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and more importantly,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:42.01,0:53:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm confident I'll be cured,\Nso stop treating me like a patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.56,0:53:55.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.19,0:53:56.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.24,0:54:11.93,Default,,0,0,0,,And the stock purchase?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.95,0:54:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We bought 14.7% in total, 4.9% per person.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:16.83,0:54:19.45,Default,,0,0,0,,And the directors supporting the chairman?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.13,0:54:29.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The rate of return of the last\Nblind trust was close to 90%,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.55,0:54:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}so they're eager to join the next fund.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.85,0:54:36.33,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to lead them to put\NQueens stocks up as collateral next.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.35,0:54:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,The minimum amount is so high,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.23,0:54:41.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt they can come up\Nwith that much cash in days.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.27,0:54:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,If we rush them, they'll put\Ntheir stocks up as collateral.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.40,0:54:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Next is Chairman Hong.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.70,0:54:50.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The prosecution investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.16,0:54:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.28,0:54:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,He hates jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.21,0:55:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, how will you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.79,0:55:05.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The chairman's real safekeeper...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.09,0:55:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}is Song Jeong-beom in Finance.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.51,0:55:12.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's siphoning off his own share,\Nas well as the chairman's slush funds.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.10,0:55:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll hand all the evidence\Nover to the prosecution,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.10,0:55:18.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and as they look into the higher-ups,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.39,0:55:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,they'll end up investigating the chairman, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.99,0:55:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You can see the Queens Tower from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.41,0:55:41.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and I like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.83,0:55:45.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It feels like I'm looking at a delicious meal.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.02,0:56:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.40,0:56:10.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you to make the font bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.07,0:56:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it. Prepare the documents\Nagain and set another meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.82,0:56:16.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe them.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.62,0:56:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.12,0:56:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.59,0:56:32.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I think I can let you join\Nthe private equity fund.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.18,0:56:34.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}The minimum amount is $20 million,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.72,0:56:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}and you can put your Queens stocks\Nup as collateral if you're short of cash.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:38.47,0:56:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}The earnings rate's expected to\Nbe higher. First come, first served,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.64,0:56:44.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}so make a quick decision.\NConfidentiality is a must.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.73,0:56:46.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Thank you.\N- I understand.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.36,0:56:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}That's possible.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:51.19,0:56:53.01,Default,,0,0,0,,She's already here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:53.03,0:56:56.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's gotten into Beom-ja?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.49,0:57:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Why does she suddenly\Nwant to treat me to a meal?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.58,0:57:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,The chairman has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.73,0:57:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Dad. You can't leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.31,0:57:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,- Over my dead body.\N- Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.94,0:57:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, just hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.07,0:57:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want anything else.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.32,0:57:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give me a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.70,0:57:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.95,0:57:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I give you a chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.24,0:57:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I gave you one, but you sold me\Nout to the prosecution to save yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.25,0:57:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,While I was locked up,\Nyou schemed to take my place...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.54,0:57:52.15,Default,,0,0,0,,with the directors who supported you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.17,0:57:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,- Have you forgotten?\N- I wasn't in my right mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.67,0:57:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you were trying to pin\Nthe embezzlement charge on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.22,0:58:00.32,Default,,0,0,0,,so I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.35,0:58:02.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.77,0:58:05.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been 20 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:05.48,0:58:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You would've even forgiven\Na stranger after this long.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.98,0:58:09.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so harsh on your son?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:09.81,0:58:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd rather forgive a stranger!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.07,0:58:15.39,Default,,0,0,0,,How could I forgive my\Nown child who betrayed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.32,0:58:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I just can't,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:18.57,0:58:20.55,Default,,0,0,0,,so never do something like this again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.58,0:58:22.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.58,0:58:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.37,0:58:26.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's really why I came.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.96,0:58:32.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you've seen me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.55,0:58:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to...
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.55,0:58:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.72,0:58:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You ingrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.51,0:58:41.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't even come to my funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.72,0:58:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Darn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:05.91,0:59:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you look so down?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:08.96,0:59:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems you haven't eaten.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.55,0:59:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're not feeling well,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.67,0:59:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,there's nothing better than...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.30,0:59:21.21,Default,,0,0,0,,a bowl of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.22,0:59:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My mother always made me this when I was sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.47,0:59:30.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Back when I used to sell newspapers\Nand shine people's shoes in Myeong-dong.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.94,0:59:33.64,Default,,0,0,0,,When I was hungry or sick,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.40,0:59:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I always thought of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.74,0:59:40.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.07,0:59:45.86,Default,,0,0,0,,From sleeping on the streets\Nusing newspapers as blankets,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.95,0:59:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,to owning one of Korea's top\Ndepartment stores and mart franchises,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.79,0:59:54.33,Default,,0,0,0,,it took 60 years,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.17,0:59:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,but why does it feel like...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.63,1:00:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm standing alone in the wilderness?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.34,1:00:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Something must've hurt your feelings badly.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.51,1:00:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Only I know how tender-hearted...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.39,1:00:09.34,Default,,0,0,0,,you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.45,1:00:25.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It tastes just like...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.49,1:00:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,my mother's.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.46,1:00:36.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't you give us a refund?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.13,1:00:38.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My baby's skin got ruined after she used this,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.76,1:00:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,but you can't give us a refund,\Nlet alone compensate us?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.18,1:00:45.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, it's been over eight months\Nsince you purchased the product,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.47,1:00:47.66,Default,,0,0,0,,and you've almost used it all.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.68,1:00:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey. I'm glad you brought it up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.60,1:00:52.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My face looks like this\Nbecause I used this much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.48,1:00:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,If I hadn't, my skin\Nwouldn't have become like this!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.56,1:00:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Babe, don't get worked up. It'll get worse.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:59.07,1:01:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just give us a refund right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.07,1:01:02.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.95,1:01:05.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't I make myself clear enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.16,1:01:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please calm down.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.33,1:01:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I calm down?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.29,1:01:18.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. You think I'm one of those\Nobnoxious customers, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.38,1:01:21.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Want me to show you the real thing?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.34,1:01:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, you can't do this here.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:29.22,1:01:33.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I wanted to use our security deposit for\Nher surgery, but my mom won't listen.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.19,1:01:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This is an unreasonable\Ndemand. We can't help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.11,1:01:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,"Unreasonable"?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:41.57,1:01:45.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You're hopeless. Come here.\NHow dare you talk to me...?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.91,1:01:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:51.99,1:01:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:53.58,1:01:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.29,1:02:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't the place for such behavior.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.13,1:02:03.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, I have no business with you small fry.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.76,1:02:04.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring your CEO.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.97,1:02:07.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring your CEO right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.59,1:02:09.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- She's here.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.26,1:02:11.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the CEO.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.14,1:02:13.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you the CEO?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.43,1:02:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you train your employee properly?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.89,1:02:18.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. I don't think I did it properly.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.98,1:02:22.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Ms. Kim Min-ji?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.44,1:02:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal with our customers only.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.15,1:02:28.05,Default,,0,0,0,,As for criminals, report them\Nto the police without warning.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.07,1:02:30.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What? A criminal?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.41,1:02:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You call your customers criminals?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.83,1:02:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Babe, are you filming this?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:34.66,1:02:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.91,1:02:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The CEO of this mall looks\Ndown on her customers.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.71,1:02:40.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's sue her and teach her a lesson.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.00,1:02:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:43.59,1:02:45.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure to do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.21,1:02:46.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I will too.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.93,1:02:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I know well, since my husband is a good lawyer.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.85,1:02:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You can be charged...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.10,1:02:55.03,Default,,0,0,0,,with obstruction of business, special assault,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.06,1:02:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,and property damage,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.44,1:03:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'll file another suit for\Nthe sales loss you caused.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.52,1:03:04.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you all film it?\N- Yes, we did!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.78,1:03:07.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- I did. Here!\N- Please make way.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.24,1:03:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Take them to the police.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.57,1:03:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Babe.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.46,1:03:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:25.38,1:03:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, Mr. Baek, about Park Seok-hun.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:28.59,1:03:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What about him?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:30.38,1:03:33.07,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going around saying...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.10,1:03:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,that the Yongdu Pear you're promoting\Nas our village specialty has no future.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.10,1:03:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He claims the Yongdu Apple will be...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.56,1:03:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the new K-food craze around the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.98,1:03:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Apple? Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.82,1:03:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's just ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.36,1:03:48.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Traditionally, apples are no match for pears.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.82,1:03:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course... Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.07,1:03:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Just think about memorial services.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.08,1:03:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,We put pears on the tables, not apples!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:56.62,1:04:00.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, persimmons and pears go\Ntogether. Persimmons and apples don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.75,1:04:04.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare he downplay the importance\Nof pears, our traditional fruit?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:05.00,1:04:07.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyway, this guy's running...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.38,1:04:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,an election campaign in such smart ways.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.13,1:04:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You know his mom's restaurant?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.59,1:04:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He's offering half-price lunches,\Nso everyone's eating there now.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.47,1:04:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:19.52,1:04:21.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me sooner?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.69,1:04:23.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That little...!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.40,1:04:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,He's not playing fair, is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.98,1:04:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you going there?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.78,1:04:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Half-Price Lunch{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.74,1:04:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.74,1:04:40.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Park.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:40.20,1:04:42.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The soup is especially good today.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.16,1:04:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. It's always been good.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.00,1:04:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.71,1:04:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like a feast.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.88,1:04:51.86,Default,,0,0,0,,We should compete with pledges and plans,
Dialogue: 0,1:04:51.88,1:04:55.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's trying to win people\Nover with a popular song.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:55.60,1:04:59.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, if he wins the election like this,\Nit's not his victory. It's the singer's!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.64,1:05:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be considered an\Nelection law violation. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.27,1:05:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Chun-sik, gather the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:06.23,1:05:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Those who entertain and those who\Nplay along. I'll report the whole lot!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.15,1:05:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.24,1:05:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all doomed.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.24,1:05:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. What...?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.66,1:05:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Mr. Baek.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.30,1:05:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Seok-hun! I'll have one more pork platter.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.76,1:05:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,One more soju, too!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.89,1:05:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so delicious!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.47,1:05:43.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That piece of...!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.02,1:05:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You son of...!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.19,1:05:46.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I oughta...!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.31,1:05:47.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How bad is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.56,1:05:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He walked right into their trap.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.32,1:05:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Family corruption. It's an issue even\Nthe country's presidents couldn't avoid.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.07,1:05:58.80,Default,,0,0,0,,The current village head's son let\Nthe opposite side treat him to a meal.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.82,1:06:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,People say the head's family is ruined,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.29,1:06:05.56,Default,,0,0,0,,because his children\Nweren't properly disciplined.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.58,1:06:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You idiot!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.87,1:06:08.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.34,1:06:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Dad, I'll change their opinion.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.67,1:06:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,What can you do?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.92,1:06:15.98,Default,,0,0,0,,My salon produces roughly 90%
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.01,1:06:18.70,Default,,0,0,0,,of the rumors going around Yongdu-ri.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.72,1:06:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, gossipers!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.06,1:06:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,- We can use them.\N- Like a smear campaign?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:23.93,1:06:27.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly! Seok-hun stole snacks from our store...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:27.10,1:06:28.37,Default,,0,0,0,,when he was a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.40,1:06:29.62,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll expose that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:29.65,1:06:33.43,Default,,0,0,0,,"He who will steal an egg will steal an ox!"
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.73,1:06:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:36.70,1:06:38.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Got a cigarette?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.03,1:06:39.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I quit smoking.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:56.76,1:06:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi-seon, are you coming?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:58.01,1:07:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Your father and Seok-hun\Nwill have a big face-off.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.01,1:07:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.39,1:07:08.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think so. Your family needs as\Nmany people as possible on their side.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.14,1:07:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- What do you mean, "why"?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:10.35,1:07:13.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Because the head is at a disadvantage now.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:13.27,1:07:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:14.86,1:07:15.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just come!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:15.94,1:07:18.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My gosh! Just go!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.15,1:07:19.63,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Pinky!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.66,1:07:21.55,Default,,0,0,0,,You go back in.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:21.57,1:07:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm standing here...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.12,1:07:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}because our village needs young people.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:27.00,1:07:28.31,Default,,0,0,0,,As I said earlier,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.33,1:07:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll make the Yongdu Apple a K-food\Nloved by people around the world!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.46,1:07:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Park Seok-hun, will recover\Nthe two years Yongdu-ri lost!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.55,1:07:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,He's well received.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.18,1:07:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.35,1:07:45.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.68,1:07:48.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone, our Yongdu-ri...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:48.77,1:07:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,is like the heart of Korean pears.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.85,1:07:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, isn't the heart of pears Naju or Seongju?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.86,1:08:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right! Yongdu-ri isn't\Nthe heart. It's more like...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.53,1:08:01.59,Default,,0,0,0,,How do I put it?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.61,1:08:04.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's more like the intestine.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.41,1:08:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:06.66,1:08:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. If it were the heart, our pears...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.91,1:08:14.06,Default,,0,0,0,,would be sold at his daughter-\Nin-law's department store.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.09,1:08:16.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:17.96,1:08:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why bring that up here?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.34,1:08:22.61,Default,,0,0,0,,My daughter-in-law...
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.64,1:08:25.32,Default,,0,0,0,,keeps her work and private life apart!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.35,1:08:27.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I get that she's a good CEO,
Dialogue: 0,1:08:27.89,1:08:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,but her private life?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.93,1:08:32.25,Default,,0,0,0,,To be blunt, we only heard\Nshe and your son got married.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.27,1:08:35.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- We've never seen her.\N- Didn't she come on a chopper?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.90,1:08:38.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. I thought war had broken out then.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:38.78,1:08:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's true that she's never\Nvisited since they got married.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:41.78,1:08:44.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It was before they got married?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.83,1:08:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.58,1:08:50.90,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is it an earthquake?\N- What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.29,1:08:52.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Community Hall{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.59,1:09:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's that?\N- Film it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.01,1:09:05.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They brought a lot.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.08,1:09:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Father?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.42,1:09:39.81,Default,,0,0,0,,My gosh.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.84,1:09:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.52,1:09:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.39,1:09:56.71,Default,,0,0,0,,She came.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.73,1:09:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.40,1:10:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.03,1:10:11.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're all here.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.08,1:10:13.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I missed your last birthday,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.29,1:10:17.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so I came to treat the villagers to a meal.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.46,1:10:25.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, I'm Hong Hae-in, the\Nvillage head's daughter-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.14,1:10:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:30.43,1:10:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I texted her.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.01,1:10:35.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}You said you'd visit us one of these days.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.31,1:10:39.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Can that day be today and right now?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:39.40,1:10:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}My father's running for re-election,\Nand it's not looking good.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.78,1:10:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}I think he needs to show people\Nsomeone influential is supporting him.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.76,1:10:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She read it! It says "read."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.05,1:11:05.25,Default,,0,0,0,,She came because of that text?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:05.30,1:11:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it, either.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.88,1:11:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Good job!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.10,1:11:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.43,1:11:13.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not much.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.81,1:11:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Expensive nutritional supplements, ginseng,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.02,1:11:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,cosmetics, silk scarves, cashmere mufflers,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.23,1:11:22.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Italian leather gloves, so on.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.52,1:11:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I was going to buy just a little for Father,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:25.28,1:11:26.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but I went overboard.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.49,1:11:28.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You can share.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.36,1:11:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my. I can't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.07,1:11:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You bought too much.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.16,1:11:39.10,Default,,0,0,0,,- Baek Du-gwan!\N- Baek Du-gwan!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.12,1:11:44.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in!\N- Baek Du-gwan!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.04,1:11:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone! What's Yongdu-ri's\Nspecialty? Apples or pears?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:47.30,1:11:49.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- Pears!\N- Pears!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.59,1:11:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- Baek Du-gwan!\N- Baek Du-gwan!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.68,1:11:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in!\N- Baek Du-gwan!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.10,1:11:58.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Baek Du-gwan\NA hard worker who protects Yongdu-ri{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.71,1:12:31.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hyun-woo. Hae-in's here.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.47,1:12:36.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey.\N- {\i1}Mom, I missed your call.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.60,1:12:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all right. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.81,1:12:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Mi-seon and Hyeon-tae went\Nthere. You must've been surprised.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:42.60,1:12:46.17,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's okay. Nothing bad\Nhappened, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.19,1:12:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}And Hae-in is...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.48,1:12:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she's doing well too.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.47,1:12:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:50.53,1:12:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Did you two fight?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.95,1:12:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:54.95,1:12:57.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why don't you know where she is?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.70,1:12:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}She's here.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.66,1:13:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why would she be there?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.75,1:13:03.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You should come ask her yourself.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:03.50,1:13:06.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}The whole village is having\Na feast, thanks to her.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:08.30,1:13:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What's she talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.26,1:13:14.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Hae-in right now?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:41.37,1:13:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Baek Hyun-woo{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.62,1:15:07.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.29,1:15:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.17,1:15:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the daughter-in-law.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.04,1:15:14.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who are you?\N- I know everyone in this family,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.42,1:15:16.33,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've never seen you.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.72,1:15:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't come here often.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:24.89,1:15:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you looking at me like\Nthat? I'm part of the family.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.56,1:15:29.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what's the dog's name?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.31,1:15:33.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Musty.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:33.61,1:15:34.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Spotty?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.61,1:15:36.25,Default,,0,0,0,,They have no dog.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:36.28,1:15:37.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You look suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.49,1:15:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you so suspicious?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.61,1:15:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm the wife of Baek Hyun-woo,\Nthe son of this family. Happy? Now go.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:43.20,1:15:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the building owner.\NYou should've told me sooner.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.29,1:15:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- My dad told me...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.33,1:15:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Uncle Hyun-woo's wife is\Nthe owner of our building.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.84,1:15:56.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me properly greet you, Aunt.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.46,1:15:59.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm Baek Ho-yeol.\N- I see.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:59.51,1:16:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my nephew that I only heard about.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.05,1:16:03.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.51,1:16:05.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw an unfamiliar car in front of the house.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.97,1:16:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Is it yours, Aunt?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.43,1:16:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.81,1:16:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,That's sick.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.19,1:16:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,A V8 engine, the horsepower and speed tuning.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.32,1:16:19.39,Default,,0,0,0,,That rare car is really yours?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.70,1:16:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Could I have a ride, please?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.24,1:16:26.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If I let you, will you stop talking to me?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.95,1:16:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.50,1:16:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you drive him around the village?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.46,1:16:37.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe three or four laps.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.25,1:16:38.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.41,1:18:34.39,Default,,0,0,0,,My youngest is here!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.41,1:18:35.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.87,1:18:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,The massage chair you gave us last time.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.29,1:18:42.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so good. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:42.67,1:18:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends told me to take a\Npicture with you when I met you.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.51,1:18:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.68,1:18:50.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Two, three.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.01,1:18:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, but can you step aside?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.10,1:18:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.56,1:18:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your arm, too.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.85,1:18:57.75,Default,,0,0,0,,- Even my arm?\N- Just the two of us.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.77,1:19:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, now. He installed air conditioners\Nand boilers in our senior center.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.52,1:19:07.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo's the pride of Yongdu-ri.\NGive him a round of applause!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:07.78,1:19:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.95,1:19:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:10.03,1:19:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Eat your fill.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:16.12,1:19:17.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:17.46,1:19:20.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it from your brother and sister,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.71,1:19:23.04,Default,,0,0,0,,but don't worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.09,1:19:25.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I never mentioned the divorce to your wife.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.76,1:19:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mentioning it now, Dad.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.51,1:19:29.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.51,1:19:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not here. She's at home.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:32.30,1:19:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- No, she's not.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.72,1:19:36.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I just picked up Ho-yeol. She wasn't there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:36.39,1:19:37.99,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.02,1:19:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not there.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.32,1:19:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mr. Baek.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.91,1:19:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.12,1:19:59.36,Default,,0,0,0,,She isn't at the community hall?\NWhen I came back, she wasn't here.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.35,1:20:19.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.44,1:20:23.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:23.44,1:20:25.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:28.86,1:20:30.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.05,1:20:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:51.30,1:20:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:09.32,1:21:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.45,1:21:57.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:03.75,1:22:06.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why are you here?\N- Why are you yelling?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.29,1:22:11.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard you came here out of the blue,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.59,1:22:14.61,Default,,0,0,0,,so I came, but you weren't home...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.63,1:22:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,or at the hall. No one knew where you were.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.80,1:22:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't answer your phone!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.97,1:22:20.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.06,1:22:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,- why are you here...?\N- Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:25.23,1:22:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I came out for a walk.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.94,1:22:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,A walk in this neighborhood?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.36,1:22:34.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.86,1:22:38.40,Default,,0,0,0,,- I was worried!\N- Why would you be?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.53,1:22:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not a patient.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.75,1:22:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.00,1:22:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you told me that.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.38,1:22:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I yelled.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:27.66,1:23:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,The truth is...
Dialogue: 0,1:23:30.92,1:23:32.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.13,1:23:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't remember at all why I was there.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.52,1:23:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I was in front of your house,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.60,1:23:53.47,Default,,0,0,0,,then suddenly I was somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.74,1:23:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know when I went there,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.45,1:24:03.19,Default,,0,0,0,,or how.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.33,1:24:08.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I have no idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.96,1:24:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I was...
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.25,1:24:17.96,Default,,0,0,0,,so scared.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.17,1:25:42.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Named Outstanding School of 2006{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.92,1:25:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- We're here.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:46.18,1:25:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- See you later.\N- See you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.89,1:25:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:53.43,1:25:56.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Seoul people aren't that\Ndifferent. Don't feel discouraged.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:56.52,1:25:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand firm.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.57,1:26:00.13,Default,,0,0,0,,- Firm.\N- Stand upright,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:00.15,1:26:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,and try to glare like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.19,1:26:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,- Okay.\N- Good. Go in.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.07,1:26:07.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- Bye, Dad.\N- Bye.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.16,1:26:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- Listen to your teacher.\N- Drive safely!
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.17,1:26:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in's going to the U.S. to study.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.34,1:26:21.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Say goodbye to her, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.38,1:26:23.62,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes, sir.\N- Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.93,1:26:28.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at her face.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:28.76,1:26:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,She's still so full of herself.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.81,1:26:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a rumor that she's being\Nadmitted to a mental hospital.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.35,1:26:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard it's because she went\Nmad after her brother died.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:21.02,1:27:22.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:34.99,1:27:36.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.29,1:27:41.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't need it.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:58.18,1:28:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Clean it and put some ointment on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.41,1:28:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.91,1:28:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.84,1:28:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You are.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:43.27,1:28:46.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.38,1:29:15.32,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Don't you dare mention the divorce.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.35,1:29:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}You got it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:17.06,1:29:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Divorce is nothing.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:19.35,1:29:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I wanted to get a divorce too.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.39,1:29:24.87,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- {\i1}What's wrong?\N- Don't mind me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.90,1:29:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}How could their love die?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:27.02,1:29:29.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}They used to be madly in love.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.61,1:29:32.59,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}The woman I love right now is you.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.61,1:29:34.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Your white blood cell count is too low.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.57,1:29:36.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'll find a way.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.57,1:29:38.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Even if I have to search the world,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:38.37,1:29:39.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I'll find a way to live.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:39.87,1:29:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}So I should be...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.50,1:29:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}with you in times like these.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:44.00,1:29:45.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}I wanted you...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.04,1:29:47.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}to be with me.{\i0}
